{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00813","headline":"郊庙歌辞 汉宗庙乐舞辞 武德舞 · 张昭","name":"郊庙歌辞 汉宗庙乐舞辞 武德舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明明我祖，天集休明。\n神母夜哭，彤云昼兴。\n笾豆有践，管龠斯登。\n孝孙致告，神其降灵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}